            "value" : "RYFT kann für dein Konto gerade keine Trainingsdateien importieren. Die Datei wurde weder gelesen noch verändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RYFT can't read %@ data on iPhone today." : {
      "comment" : "A tracker that writes nothing to Apple Health, on its setup card and in Check sync. The argument is its name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RYFT kann die Daten von %@ auf dem iPhone derzeit nicht lesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RYFT can't read these columns yet, so this exercise's sets were skipped" : {
      "comment" : "Import warning, after \"Line N\": a set table with other columns than weight and reps.",
